v1.3.9
A new Stats switches panel in the Bot menu shows every Xray statistics switch,
the feature that depends on it and any client level that is still missing,
with a one-tap validated repair. Empty online, user-traffic and node-traffic
cards now link directly to that panel. Provisioning also enables the
policy.system inbound counters, so node traffic works after an in-menu upgrade.
The first start of this version runs the one-time check and restarts Xray only
if a required switch was off.
